## Parámetros mínimos

```python
def mi_tabla_params() -> dict:
    return {
        "query_mode": "aggregate",
        "groupby": ["campo_dimension"],
        "metrics": [metric_sum("campo", "Etiqueta")],
        "row_limit": 5000,
        "server_pagination": False,
        "show_totals": True,
        "include_search": True,
        "show_cell_bars": False,
        "column_config": {
            "campo_dimension": {
                "customColumnName": "Nombre",
                "truncateLongCells": True,
                "columnWidth": 280,
            },
            "Etiqueta": {
                "d3NumberFormat": ",.0f",
                "currencyFormat": {"symbol": "EUR", "symbolPosition": "suffix"},
                "showCellBars": False,
                "truncateLongCells": True,
            },
        },
    }
```

`viz_type` en `charts_config`: **`"ag-grid-table"`** (nunca `"table"` legacy).

